- **Built Type**: More important than Sheet Material. Is it more important than Area (Rank 2)? Built Type (portable vs fixed) is a fundamental routing signal — a seller cannot respond at all if they only make portable units and the buyer needs a fixed structure. This should slot at Rank 2, pushing Area to Rank 3. `would_be_rank: 2`. ✅ Assign.

